WEBVTT

25:33.767 --> 25:36.686
Perhaps I'll write to my sister,
the queen, about it.

25:39.064 --> 25:41.274
We'll talk later, Lord Snow.

25:47.114 --> 25:51.535
Everybody knew what this place was
and no one told me.

25:51.660 --> 25:52.994
No one but you.

25:53.912 --> 25:57.666
My father knew and he left me to rot
at the Wall all the same.

25:57.791 --> 25:59.876
Grenn's father left him too...
